[x] make fresh init produce a resolvable root charter and routable plan directories $Dogfood e2e in /tmp/clearhead-dogfood.wdSBZS: init then add charter --alias dogfood emits an implicit parent equal to the workspace display name, which doctor reports as unresolvable. add plan --charter dogfood then writes under plans/<workspace>-dogfood; loader invents a charterless Plan owner, and sync calendar fails: charter carries plans but has no actions_file to stamp into. Fresh-workspace add/action/archive and graph otherwise work. Add an acceptance test covering init -> add charter -> add recurring plan -> sync calendar.$ !1 +bug %2026-07-29T16:22 #019faff7-0066-7ea1-b717-040802e75ebf
