[x] Make recovered action source impossible to rewrite $DONE 2026-07-30. Added core TrustedDocument/IntegrityError capability; existing-source format APIs require trusted input and Topiary no longer tolerates recovery on typed serialization. Workspace loading quarantines malformed action files from semantic/domain state while retaining findings, doctor defers sidecar orphan pruning during quarantine, and calendar sync refuses partial models. CLI format/normalize reject recovered input even on stdout. LSP formatting returns no edit, didSave skips telemetry/sidecar writes from recovered trees, and a surgical Close incomplete link code action inserts the missing delimiter. Grammar keeps link nodes/concealment and permits multiline links, while an unescaped opening bracket synchronizes missing-close recovery before the next action marker. Historical regression proves two actions and UUID attachment remain separate. Full core, CLI, LSP, and graphd suites pass; real installed-binary dogfood confirms formatting fails with zero stdout and byte-stable source, reads quarantine it, and doctor reports syntax only without pruning provenance.$ !1 +bug %2026-07-30T00:46 #019fb1ed-ff3d-7823-a437-b1c63f93d860
