[x] get docs folder up-to-date with knowledge structure $Migrated docs (DECISIONS/CONTRIBUTING/SUBMODULES/WORKTREES/workflows/history baseline) into docs/ as an OKF v0.2 bundle, but left them without frontmatter, unlinked from index.md, and index.md itself a bare stub. Fixed 2026-09-18: added frontmatter (type/status/generated with real git-history provenance dates) to all six, wrote a real index.md, fixed one genuinely dead link (DECISIONS.md pointed at an archived charter's old path). okf validate docs now reports is_conformant/gate_passed true, stale_count 0. Adopted the frontmatter convention only, not the okf CLI's mutating commands (okf update destructively wipes existing file bodies instead of retrofitting frontmatter - confirmed and avoided; use it for validate/search/show only, never create/update/relate on existing content without checking the diff first).$ !2 %2026-09-17T21:56 #01a0b274-1dfd-7ad0-9763-f611a6298838
